{
  "case_id": "SHOP-M-1.21.1",
  "title": "卡牌商店·任务M：真人鼠标拖拽真正可用（跨 tick 真实屏幕事件）/ 沙漏去数字 / 探针护栏（未武装零动作）",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "card-shop"
  },
  "on_fail": "continue",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "任务M 1.21.1 实机验收。三个场景全部由客户端探针 astral_shop_client.js 按「开店瞬间余额哨兵」选模式：783=跨 tick 真实屏幕事件拖拽（§8）/ 784=沙漏去数字取证（§7）/ 785=几何窗口（给 OS 级真鼠标脚本换算像素坐标，屏保持开着不自关）。拖拽证据一律走 CardShopScreen#mouseClicked/mouseDragged/mouseReleased 真实屏幕事件路径，绝不用合成业务载荷。"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode creative",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "①-§8 拖拽（哨兵 783）：探针跨 tick 派发 click(卡框0) → drag(中点) → drag(落点) → release(落点)，全程与真人时序一致（修前会被 CardShopScreen#containerTick 的 isLeftPressed 兜底清掉 dragIndex ⇒ 不发购买）"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal M0 783",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop cycleset M0 60",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep M0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 6000
    },
    {
      "op": "screenshot",
      "tag": "shopM-783-after",
      "mode": "window",
      "crop": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "②-§7 沙漏去数字（哨兵 784）：cd>0 主视图截图 → 归零进转账面板 → 面板内 cd>0 截图 → 返回主视图再截一次；修前主视图沙漏上有金色秒数、面板确认键下有红色「冷却 N 秒」；另加逐 tick 采样 evt=h_t 判定「面板+cd>0」是否真的被渲染过（见 evt=h_burst 汇总）"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal H0 784",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep H0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 9000
    },
    {
      "op": "screenshot",
      "tag": "shopM-784-after",
      "mode": "window",
      "crop": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1500
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "③-§1.4 几何窗口（哨兵 785）：屏保持开着，用例到此结束，随后由 temp/t88/real_human_drag.ps1 用 OS 级真实鼠标（SetCursorPos + SendInput）拖拽卡框 → 物品栏，再按真实 ESC 关屏"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop bal G0 785",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep G0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "op": "screenshot",
      "tag": "shopM-785-open",
      "mode": "window",
      "crop": true
    }
  ],
